{{Wireless adapter |brand=Askey |model=WLC030 |revision= |upc= |ean= |asin= |price= |est_release_date= |fcc_date=06/25/2002 |manuf_country=Taiwan |is_manuf=No |manuf= |manuf_model= |manuf_rev= |availability= |if=PCMCIA (16-bit) |if_bus_version= |if_connector_type= |form_factor= |vendor_id= |device_id= |subvendor_id= |subdevice_id= |id_string= |fcc_id=H8NWLC030 |ic_id= |chip1_brand=Atmel |chip1_model=AT76C502A |chip2_brand= |chip2_model= |chip3_brand= |chip3_model= |chip4_brand= |chip4_model= |addl_chips= |accessible_UART=No |flags= |ant_conn= |802dot11_protocols=b |txchains= |rxchains= |sstreams= |oui= |lin_driver= |win_driver= }} This device is the same as DPW700 w/ FCC ID [[FCC ID::H8N-DPW700]]. It may also be known as the SB2200.
"WLC030 REV:1", "3017-000111", and "RF8WIRELESS DIV. 11.13.01" is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos.
